# Extra paths `tauri dev` must NOT watch for changes.
#
# Tauri already ignores `target/`, but this repo lives in iCloud Drive, so the
# real Rust build folder is named `target.nosync` (iCloud skips anything ending
# in .nosync) and `target` is only a shortcut to it. Tauri's watcher doesn't
# recognise that name, sees every build artifact as a source change, and rebuilds
# the app forever in a loop.
#
# See README.md ("One quirk: iCloud and the .nosync folders").
target.nosync/
gen/
